<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`CHANGED_LINK: number = 32`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer CHANGED_LINK = 32;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHANGED_LINK has the value 0x20</p>
  <p>The number of prims making up the object or avatars seated on the object have changed. This event also occurs when duplicating a linked object or when a prim in an object changes type or shape. This event does not occur when: an object is attached or detached, in an attachment when the avatar sits or unsits, in an attachment when another object is attached or detached, or when a single prim is duplicated.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
